opendesign-design-systems
=========================

This plugin contains design-system packages adapted from the Open Design
project (nexu-io/open-design), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  Copyright (c) Open Design contributors.
  https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Each package keeps its original machine-readable shape:
  design-systems/<slug>/
    ├── manifest.json   (discovery metadata)
    ├── DESIGN.md       (canonical design prose for agents)
    └── tokens.css      (compiled semantic tokens)
  (plus optional design-tokens.json, USAGE.md, components.html, tailwind-v4.css)

Changes made in this distribution:
  - Rewrote host-specific product references to FreeCode in prose/metadata.
  - Retained token values, categories, and design guidance unchanged.

